  "title": "Arizer ArGo Portable Vaporizer (taxes extra)",
  "description": "The Arizer ArGo\n\nShort for “Arizer Go”\nThe ArGo is meticulously engineered in an innovative, powerful, and ultra-compact design.\n\nUltimate Portability\nGo Discreetly. Go Farther. Go Longer. Go Prepared.\n\nGo The Distance\n\nAll the power you need with High Capacity, Rechargeable,\nInterchangeable Batteries, USB charging & Use While Charging.\n\nSimple and easy to use. Pure and Tasty Vapor.\nEasy to clean, the vaporizer itself is maintenance free\n\nFull digital controls, long lasting battery, great vapor and a solid case.\n\nSimple digital controls allow you to customize all settings including brightness and session length. Easy to use and a fast heat up time means you’ll be vaporizing in no time. Adjust the temperature to produce a light smooth vapor or turn up the heat for a thicker hotter vapor, you decide.\n\nBONUS ITEMS: – 4 Piece Premium Grinder, 4 Screens, 2 Cleaning Sticks\n\nFeatures:\nDigital Temperature Control\nEasy to Use, low maintenace\nUltra compact\nSmooth plentiful vapor\nUSB Charging\nSwappable Batteries\nLasts up to 90 Minutes\nCan be used while charging\n\nDETAILS\n\nThe Arizer ArGo includes:\n1 x ArGo Portable Micro-Heater\n1 x ArGo Battery\n1 x ArGo USB Charger /Power Adapter\n2 x ArGo Glass Aroma Tube\n1 x ArGo Belt-Clip Carry Case\n2 x ArGo Silicone Stem Caps\n1 x Stainless Steel Stirring Tool\n4 x Stainless Steel Filter Screens\n1 x Owners Manual\n\nWARRANTY\n\nSaveSaveSaveSaveSaveSaveSaveSaveSaveSaveSaveSaveSaveSaveSaveSaveSaveSave",
  "description_html": "<p><strong>The Arizer ArGo<br /> <br />Short for “Arizer Go”</strong><br />The ArGo is meticulously engineered in an innovative, powerful, and ultra-compact design.</p>\n<p><strong>Ultimate Portability</strong><br />Go Discreetly. Go Farther. Go Longer. Go Prepared.</p>\n<p><strong>Go The Distance</strong></p>\n<p>All the power you need with High Capacity, Rechargeable,<br />Interchangeable Batteries, USB charging &amp; Use While Charging.</p>\n<p>Simple and easy to use. Pure and Tasty Vapor. <br />Easy to clean, the vaporizer itself is maintenance free</p>\n<p>Full digital controls, long lasting battery, great vapor and a solid case.</p>\n<p>Simple digital controls allow you to customize all settings including brightness and session length. Easy to use and a fast heat up time means you&#8217;ll be vaporizing in no time. Adjust the temperature to produce a light smooth vapor or turn up the heat for a thicker hotter vapor, you decide.   </p>\n<p><strong>BONUS ITEMS: &#8211;</strong> 4 Piece Premium Grinder, 4 Screens, 2 Cleaning Sticks<strong><br /></strong></p>\n<table width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td> <strong>Features:</strong><br />Digital Temperature Control<br />Easy to Use, low maintenace<br />Ultra compact<br />Smooth plentiful vapor<br />USB Charging<br />Swappable Batteries<br />Lasts up to 90 Minutes<br />Can be used while charging</td>\n<td>  </p>\n<div style=\"text-align: left\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><img style=\"margin-right: 33.6875px;margin-left: 33.675px;float: none\" alt=\"Arizer argo features\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0266/5065/products/arizer-argo-open_medium.png?v=1516472487\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>DETAILS</p>\n<h5></h5>\n<table style=\"width: 659px\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 37.7333px\">\n<td style=\"width: 626.433px;height: 37.7333px\">The Arizer ArGo includes:<br />1 x ArGo Portable Micro-Heater<br />1 x ArGo Battery<br />1 x ArGo USB Charger /Power Adapter<br />2 x ArGo Glass Aroma Tube <br />1 x ArGo Belt-Clip Carry Case<br />2 x ArGo Silicone Stem Caps<br />1 x Stainless Steel Stirring Tool<br />4 x Stainless Steel Filter Screens<br />1 x Owners Manual<br /> </td>\n<td style=\"width: 403.567px;height: 37.7333px;text-align: left\"> </p>\n<div style=\"text-align: left\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><img style=\"margin-right: 38.9375px;margin-left: 38.9375px;float: none\" alt=\"the arizer argo details\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0266/5065/products/arizer-argo-back_medium.png?v=1516472475\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p> </p>\n<h5>WARRANTY<br /> </h5>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\"><a href=\"https://vaporizers.ca/pages/arizer-warranty-information\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0266/5065/files/warranty_6743b620-f6e8-485f-a92d-8f39f2385313_medium.jpg?v=1475077314\" alt=\"Warranty Information\" style=\"float: left\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\"> </p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\"> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span style=\"border-radius: 2px;text-indent: 20px;width: auto;padding: 0px 4px 0px 0px;text-align: center;font: bold 11px/20px &apos;Helvetica Neue&apos;,Helvetica,sans-serif;color: #ffffff;background: #bd081c  no-repeat scroll 3px 50% / 14px 14px;position: absolute;opacity: 1;z-index: 8675309;display: none;cursor: pointer;top: 681px;left: 466px\">Save</span><span style=\"border-radius: 2px;text-indent: 20px;width: auto;padding: 0px 4px 0px 0px;text-align: center;font: bold 11px/20px &apos;Helvetica Neue&apos;,Helvetica,sans-serif;color: #ffffff;background: #bd081c  no-repeat scroll 3px 50% / 14px 14px;position: absolute;opacity: 1;z-index: 8675309;display: none;cursor: pointer\">Save</span><span style=\"border-radius: 2px;text-indent: 20px;width: auto;padding: 0px 4px 0px 0px;text-align: center;font: bold 11px/20px &apos;Helvetica Neue&apos;,Helvetica,sans-serif;color: #ffffff;background: #bd081c  no-repeat scroll 3px 50% / 14px 14px;position